**Diff review:** Disjoint ownership, no conflicts, no rework needed. Ranges validates outer list/tuple, exact 2-element list/tuple pairs, `int` excluding `bool`, `start <= end` for every pair including zero-length before dropping empties; sorts and coalesces on `start <= last_end`; fresh result lists; arbitrary-size ints untouched. Tags rejects non-`str`, scans for unescaped commas with `\\` escaping only `,`/`\`, rejects trailing/unknown escapes and controls `<0x20`/`0x7F`, strips then casefolds, empty-drop, first-seen dedupe. Report calls both APIs and returns exactly `{"schema":1,"intervals":…,"covered":sum(end-start),"tags":…}` with `ValueError` propagation.

**Boundary:** local deterministic unit oracle only; no hosted, deployment, or production validation performed.
